EDF6 WeaponLimit v1.0 (edf6_weaponlimit), by AnonymousHello

src/weapon_records_logic.h, src/weapon_records_sites.inc and src/weapon_records.cpp port this plugin's relocation of
EDF6's weapon state table (the game status +0xEB50 -> +0x150A8, its constant groups A-D and the object size). Our
version is instruction-exact and persists through the game's own save / load / delete calls (docs/loadout-re.md 8.8).
No code of it is shipped verbatim.

